{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ft3dEw0RBH1795794523.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國股市在感恩節假期後復市，三大指數全線高開。</p><p></p><p>道指曾升逾500點，迫近50,700點前有阻力，指數升幅收窄。</p><p></p><p>納指早段升逾370點，曾升近24,000點大關。人工智能(AI)板塊向好，晶片商閃迪早段升約百分之9。美光科技升逾百分之2。輝達升近百分之2，其後倒跌。美國人工智能企業Anthropic曾升約百分之3。</p><p></p><p>另外，美股今日將會提早3小時收市，交易至到美東時間凌晨1時為止。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T17:04:21.852766+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:17:15.831742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:57:36.873639+00:00","content_hash":"846c2dc75c55048bea951361711aa1d0edd27f6a8434ac8c9e8a3a36ebd1bb70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}